  * Make generated code as self-explanatory as possible, and include explanatory comments where they improve understanding.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * When faced with a design choice, choose the simplest option that is sufficient for the requirements, while briefly explaining relevant more advanced alternatives.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"# Project-specific requirements","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Java version:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"Ensure that Java 25 is used when running the application or build tasks. On macOS, use `sdk use java 25.0.3.fx-zulu` to switch to Java 25 if needed.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-04T15:44:37","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"Darren50"},"content":"## Coding standards","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T17:30:41","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"Darren50"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T17:30:41","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":33,"author":{"gitId":"Darren50"},"content":"Follow the project-specific `seedu-java-coding-standard` skill for all Java code in this project.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-27T17:30:41","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":34,"author":{"gitId":"Da